# Expected-reward interval MDP (validates solve::expReachReward, Iyengar robust DP).
# s0 --(point)--> s1 ;  s1 --> s2[0.5,1.0] (target) OR stays s1[0.0,0.5] ; s2 absorbing.
# state rewards r(s0)=1, r(s1)=2, r(target)=0. Reachability reward = expected total reward
# accumulated until reaching s2.
#   pess (Rmaxmin, nature adversarial -> leave s1 ASAP, p(s1)=0): V1=2, V0=1+2 = 3
#   opt  (Rmaxmax, nature cooperative -> stay in s1, p(s1)=0.5): V1=2/(1-0.5)=4, V0=1+4 = 5
states 3
init 0
label target 2
reward 0 1
reward 1 2
tran 0 0 1:1:1
tran 1 0 2:0.5:1.0 1:0.0:0.5
tran 2 0 2:1:1
